@page
@model IndexModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Home page";
}

<div class="text-center">
    <h1 class="display-4">50 best restaurants database</h1>
    <p>
        The website <a href="https://www.the50.com/">The 50</a> lists, among other things, the 50 best restaurants in the world. For every year since 2002, the organization behind it has published a list of the best restaurants. It's an invaluable resource for foodies, but it can sometimes be awkward to navigate: For instance, restaurants are listed by the town where they are located, but not by the country. If you don't know where, say, <a asp-page="/Cities" asp-route-country="Switzerland" asp-route-city="Fürstenau">Fürstenau</a>  is, you may have to first look that up.
    </p>
    <p>
        The present website offers a browsable database of the 50 best restaurants, enabling you to look up restaurants by <a asp-area="" asp-page="/Countries" asp-route-country="">country</a>, <a asp-area="" asp-page="/Cities" asp-route-country="" asp-route-city="">city</a>, <a asp-area="" asp-page="/Years">year</a>, or <a asp-area="" asp-page="/Restaurants" asp-route-country="" asp-route-city="" asp-route-name="">name</a> It also contains historical data for all previous years the awards have been given.
    </p>
    <h2>Fair use?</h2>
    <p>
        This website is not affiliated with the organization behind The 50. This website is a non-commercial project, and is intended to be used as an additional resource that enhances the utility of The 50. The data originates from The 50, but is organized for enhanced usability.
    </p>
    <p>
        This website is not intended to be used for commercial purposes, and it does not contain any advertising.
    </p>
</div>
